  "description": "Create beautiful music that reflects your emotions. An interactive music maker where every click paints sound across the canvas of your feelings.",
  "longDescription": "Mood Melodies is a cozy, therapeutic music creation experience powered by p5.js. Express your emotions through six distinct moods - from joyful happiness to mysterious depths. Each mood transforms your touch into unique musical colors and sounds. With six different instruments and an intuitive canvas interface, there's no wrong way to create. Watch as your emotions become visual particles that dance to your musical creations. Perfect for relaxation, creative expression, or simply exploring the connection between feelings and sound.",
